                        "language": "english",
                        "review": "They took one of the worst characters from the main series and made what is essentially only a DLC sized nonsense quest for her to go on. Utterly unrelated to the main series, and has waaaaay too many walls of text instead of actual gameplay scenes. The puzzles themselves are ok, most actually make sense which is surprising for this genre, but that last maze \"puzzle\" is dumb as hell. Some of the best voice acting this series has ever had though... which isn't saying much. If you like the series and want to complete it, go ahead, but this is a pretty pointless addition to it.",
